#. Description of the plugin
#: sm-engineering.php
msgid "Partner engineers and engineering missions. Engineers apply on their own page and are approved by the platform; every study or inspection request goes to the platform, which sends a quote to the client and gives the mission to an approved engineer as a subcontractor. Clients never deal with engineers directly. Requires SM Core."
msgstr ""

#. Author of the plugin
#: sm-engineering.php
msgid "ReuSteel"
msgstr ""

